{
  "about": "Known answers for the code project path rules (DESIGN 3.2). The TypeScript validator (paths.ts) and the Rust one of the tier-2 runner (code:L16) both test against this table. problem is null when the path is allowed. A long case is a path of that many letters a. Each set is checked in order, and the first problem wins at the path named by at.",
